  TypeDef "Bag" pub
    doc "A small bag of ints that folds over its contents — an opt-in implementor of"
    doc "foldable, so it satisfies a `T: foldable<int, int>` bound."
    impl foldable<int, int>
    body list<int>
    method "fold"
